== post
POST /api/proj/mcp
400 text/plain; charset=utf-8
Accept must contain both 'application/json' and 'text/event-stream'

== get stream
GET /api/proj/mcp
400

== delete session
DELETE /api/proj/mcp
400 text/plain; charset=utf-8
Bad Request: DELETE requires an Mcp-Session-Id header

== upload unknown
PUT /api/proj/mcp/uploads/none
404 application/json
{
  "message": "upload not found or expired; call begin_upload again"
}

